==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|en|Viet-Nam|Viet Nam}}

===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|en|vi|Việt Nam}}. {{vi-etym-sino|越|[[Yue]]|南|[[south]]}}. [[越]] (pronounced ''ɢʷaːd'' in [[Old Chinese]])contains a symbol for "battleaxe", and the word also has meanings like ''to transgress, to rob'' thus "southern barbarians". Extended senses come from [[w:Vietnam War|the Vietnam War]].

