* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|en|/(ˈ)vjɛtˈnɑːm/|/(ˈ)vjɛtˈnæm/|/(ˈ)viːətˈnɑːm/|/(ˈ)viːətˈnæm/}}
** {{a|Cockney}} {{IPA|en|/ˌvjɛʔˈnɑːm/}}
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|en|/(ˈ)vjɛtˈnɑm/|/(ˈ)vjɛtˈnæm/|/ˌvi.ətˈnɑm/|/ˌvi.ətˈnæm/}}
* {{audio|en|En-us-Vietnam.ogg|Audio (US)}}
* {{a|US|rare, perhaps modeled on ''piece'' etc, or the South Vietnamese pronunciation}} {{IPA|en|/(ˈ)vitˈnɑm/|/(ˈ)vitˈnæm/}}
* {{rhymes|en|ɑːm|æm|s2=3}}

